{"seq":4,"slug":"ubiquitous-language","title":"统一语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/strategic-design/ubiquitous-language","wordCount":782,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"统一语言\">统一语言</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>统一语言（Ubiquitous Language）是领域驱动设计的基石。它要求开发团队和领域专家使用同一套语言来描述业务——这套语言贯穿于对话、文档、代码和测试中，不存在&quot;技术翻译&quot;或&quot;业务翻译&quot;的中间层。</p>\n<p>当产品经理说&quot;用户下单&quot;，代码中就应该有 <code>placeOrder</code> 方法；当领域专家说&quot;库存预留&quot;，系统中就应该有 <code>reserveInventory</code> 操作。如果代码中用的是 <code>createRecord</code> 或 <code>insertData</code>，那么每次沟通都需要额外的心智翻译，误解和 bug 就在这个翻译过程中诞生。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[领域专家&lt;br/&gt;使用业务术语] --&gt; C{统一语言}&#10;    B[开发团队&lt;br/&gt;使用代码术语] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[需求文档]&#10;    C --&gt; E[源代码]&#10;    C --&gt; F[测试用例]&#10;    C --&gt; G[API 接口]&#10;    C --&gt; H[数据库模型]\">graph LR\n    A[领域专家&lt;br/&gt;使用业务术语] --&gt; C{统一语言}\n    B[开发团队&lt;br/&gt;使用代码术语] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[需求文档]\n    C --&gt; E[源代码]\n    C --&gt; F[测试用例]\n    C --&gt; G[API 接口]\n    C --&gt; H[数据库模型]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>无统一语言</th>\n<th>有统一语言</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>沟通效率</td>\n<td>频繁误解，需要反复确认</td>\n<td>术语精确，沟通直达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码可读性</td>\n<td>技术术语充斥，业务意图模糊</td>\n<td>代码即文档，业务意图清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需求到代码的距离</td>\n<td>需要多层翻译</td>\n<td>直接映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新成员上手</td>\n<td>需要同时学习业务和&quot;代码黑话&quot;</td>\n<td>读代码就能理解业务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bug 追踪</td>\n<td>业务描述和技术描述对不上</td>\n<td>问题描述与代码位置直接关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>领域知识沉淀</td>\n<td>知识分散在人脑中</td>\n<td>知识固化在代码和模型中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"语言提炼过程\">语言提炼过程</h2><p>统一语言不是一次性定义的产物，而是通过持续对话和迭代提炼出来的。这个过程需要开发者和领域专家深度协作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 提炼前：模糊的技术化命名&#10;class OrderManager {&#10;  processItem(data: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;): void {&#10;    /* ... */&#10;  }&#10;  updateStatus(id: string, code: number): void {&#10;    /* ... */&#10;  }&#10;  handleReturn(id: string): void {&#10;    /* ... */&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 提炼后：反映业务语言的精确命名&#10;class Order {&#10;  place(items: OrderLineItem[], shippingAddress: Address): OrderConfirmation {&#10;    /* 下单 */&#10;    return {} as OrderConfirmation;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  confirm(paymentReceipt: PaymentReceipt): void {&#10;    /* 确认订单 */&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  requestReturn(reason: ReturnReason, items: OrderLineItem[]): ReturnRequest {&#10;    /* 申请退货 */&#10;    return {} as ReturnRequest;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  cancel(reason: CancellationReason): void {&#10;    /* 取消订单 */&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 提炼前：模糊的技术化命名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  processItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* ... */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  updateStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* ... */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  handleReturn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* ... */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 提炼后：反映业务语言的精确命名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  place</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderLineItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">shippingAddress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Address</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderConfirmation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    /* 下单 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {} </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderConfirmation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  confirm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#